{"detail": {"templateUuid": "47caff3f0bf24e0eba2537510153c7fd", "projectUuid": "2f075be22cee44bb9b4b20f2c5ab8f9d", "name": "中式美学丨宋画留白风格武侠演绎", "description": "我把射雕的江湖，压进山河不是人物合影，而是一整片被弓弦拉紧的山河。\n这一次，我把记忆里的《射雕英雄传》拆成六个意象：苍峰、孤骑、弯弓、飞雕、红日与万里江湖。\n高饱和烈金狂草直接压住群山，让“射雕英雄传”五个字不再只是片名，而像一道劈开天地的侠气。远处孤骑缓缓走向北境，红日之中飞雕掠过——江湖辽阔，前路未明，但真正的侠者从不会停下。\n所谓英雄，不只是武功盖世。\n更是身在江湖，心怀山河。", "coverUrl": "/assets/4f0494450533beba.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/4516157ad4cf4175bef2cb448d41b9f3/c13ad1c823b735c4806223292c74480eda459972.mp4", "snapshotId": 44249, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1740662, "ownerUuid": "4516157ad4cf4175bef2cb448d41b9f3", "avatar": "/assets/40702f645561be10.webp", "nickname": "三千问Atelier", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 29, "tags": [{"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3061, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "4. 无问西东", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3061", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1204, "code": "mv", "tagLabel": "MV", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1204/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1202, "code": "style_aesthetic", "tagLabel": "风格美学", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1202/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "25 【宋画留白风格丨我把射雕的江湖，压进山河 - 三千问Atelier-美学分享 | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 GQDI9MUi9WPChUn 😆 https://www.xiaohongs